<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 4.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - June 4.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights may be postponed at airports in central Russia on June 4 due to thick fog, the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday. - Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
</text>
